],["PRF calculator","/prf"]],"story":"<p class=\"prf-lede prf-story\">As of Oct 12, the record here runs from 1951 to 2025, 75 years in all. On the middle value of the county&rsquo;s 9 grids, September to October came in under 90% of normal in 39 of those years, and in 2025 it landed at 60%. So far in 2026, the middle shows March to April at 54% and April to May at 70%. Grid 18214 had its driest year in 2001, at 68% of normal.</p>"}
